---
kind: ObjectType
version: v1
definition:
  name: Notes
  description: Clinical and administrative case management notes for member care coordination. Documents care plans, provider communications, utilization review decisions, and appeals/grievances. Supports continuity of care and regulatory compliance (HIPAA, NCQA).
  fields:
    - name: body
      type: String_1!
      description: Free-text content of the case note. May include care plan updates, provider call summaries, authorization decisions, discharge planning, disease management interventions, or quality improvement activities.
    - name: createdAt
      type: Timestamptz!
      description: Timestamp when the note was created. Critical for audit trails, appeals timelines, and care coordination chronology.
    - name: id
      type: Uuid!
      description: Unique identifier for this case note. Primary key for note retrieval and audit logging.
    - name: memberId
      type: Uuid!
      description: Foreign key to the member this note pertains to. Links note to patient record for care coordination and utilization management.
  graphql:
    typeName: Notes
    inputTypeName: NotesInput
  dataConnectorTypeMapping:
    - dataConnectorName: neon_postgres_1
      dataConnectorObjectType: notes
      fieldMapping:
        body:
          column:
            name: body
        createdAt:
          column:
            name: created_at
        id:
          column:
            name: id
        memberId:
          column:
            name: member_id

---
